잡혔다가 예루살렘에 돌아 온 자들이 역사를 시작하고 이십 세 이상의 레위 사람들을 세워 여호와의 전 역사를 감독하게 하매</q></cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%EC%97%90%EC%8A%A4%EB%9D%BC+3%3A8&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fko.wikisource.org%2Fwiki%2F%EA%B0%9C%EC%97%AD%ED%95%9C%EA%B8%80%ED%8C%90%2F%EC%97%90%EC%8A%A4%EB%9D%BC%233%EC%9E%A5&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EB%B0%94%EB%B2%A8%EB%A1%A0+%ED%8F%AC%EB%A1%9C+%28%EB%B0%94%EB%B9%8C%EB%A1%A0+%EC%9C%A0%EC%88%98%29\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-14\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-14\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ko.wikisource.org/wiki/개역한글판/에스라#4장\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">에스라 4:1-5</a>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%EC%97%90%EC%8A%A4%EB%9D%BC+4%3A1-5&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fko.wikisource.org%2Fwiki%2F%EA%B0%9C%EC%97%AD%ED%95%9C%EA%B8%80%ED%8C%90%2F%EC%97%90%EC%8A%A4%EB%9D%BC%234%EC%9E%A5&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EB%B0%94%EB%B2%A8%EB%A1%A0+%ED%8F%AC%EB%A1%9C+%28%EB%B0%94%EB%B9%8C%EB%A1%A0+%EC%9C%A0%EC%88%98%29\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-15\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-15\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ko.wikisource.org/wiki/개역한글판/에스라#4장\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">에스라 4:17-5:2</a>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%EC%97%90%EC%8A%A4%EB%9D%BC+4%3A17-5%3A2&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fko.wikisource.org%2Fwiki%2F%EA%B0%9C%EC%97%AD%ED%9